WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:35.480
Kaiba summons three Blue-Eyes and attacks me.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:39.680
I have no monsters on my field that can withstand this attack.

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:44.680
During this hopeless situation, I remember what Jonouchi said.

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:48.800
That's right!  My hand has infinite potential!

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:55.030
Let's fight together for victory, Jonouchi's Red-Eyes!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:01.030
Fire at Hatred!
Dark Paladin

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.360
Brother!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.360
Jonouchi!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.910
Shizuka...  Everyone...

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.440
Huh?  Where am I?

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.680
Why am I here?

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.520
Jonouchi!  You're really awake!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:20.920
Honda?

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.280
What are you doing?

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.960
W-What am I doing?

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.260
Brother!

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.600
Shizuka.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.260
Thank goodness, Brother!

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:34.540
Shizuka.

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:36.730
This is great.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.270
No way!  Unbelievable!

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.470
You were on the brink of death!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:48.220
I was in Domino City's duel tournament and...

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.380
And Yugi was dueling.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.760
Was I dreaming?

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.560
Jonouchi!

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:57.160
Are you still half-asleep?

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.490
Honda!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.760
You're really awake, right?

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.060
You dummy!  You worried me to death!

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.500
Don't you dare die again!

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.140
Honda...

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:14.000
I remember!  I was fighting Marik!

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.840
Mai!  How's Mai?

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:22.700
Mai...

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.780
Why?

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.020
Mai!  Hey!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.000
Why are you still sleeping?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.480
I thought you'd wake up when I defeated Marik!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.680
I defeated Marik!

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.530
Right?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.150
What's wrong?  I won, didn't I?

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.270
Brother...

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:53.940
Umm, Brother...  You lost.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.300
What?  That can't be true!

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:00.160
I summoned Gearfried and beat Marik!

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.700
You were in a coma!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.680
We were so worried.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:07.820
We thought you might die.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.830
I win.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.280
Gearfried...

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.140
Attac-

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.170
I see.  I lost.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:40.120
Mai, I'm sorry that I couldn't save you.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:10.060
Yugi, you have two monsters on your field.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:16.860
To survive against Blue-Eyes, your only move is to put your monsters in defense position.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.230
I set two cards!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.730
I end my turn!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:28.240
These cards will block your escape route.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.810
What is Kaiba planning to do next?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.810
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.820
No matter what his set cards are...

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:44.100
...as long as my life points don't drop to 0, I have a chance to win!

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.820
That's what I must believe.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.120
I set a card!

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:52.420
And I switch Red-Eyes to defense position!

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:54.570
You won't escape.

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.530
I activate my Continuous Trap!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.350
What?  A trap?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.970
Red-Eyes switched back to attack position!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:07.820
The Continuous Trap, Final Attack Orders!

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:12.000
As long as I have this card, all monsters are in attack position.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:20.060
And both players must choose three cards in their decks and send the rest to the graveyard.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.330
What?

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:26.660
So no matter who wins, this duel will end in three turns.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:34.430
I chose these cards to get Ultimate Dragon.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.240
Yugi.

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:43.460
I'll instantly burn your illusions of the past into ash!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:49.350
I can only choose three of these cards.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.720
Which should I pick?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.660
What about the next match?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.300
What about Yugi?

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.880
He's dueling Kaiba.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:06:59.920
What?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.500
I can't stay here!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.080
Jonouchi!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:07.320
I have to watch Yugi's duel!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.600
Brother!

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:11.140
You need to rest!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.560
Where's the patient?

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:16.860
Who's the patient?

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.170
Him.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:23.060
He was in critical condition.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:26.190
Emphasis on "was."  I'm fine now.

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.220
There's nothing wrong with me.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:31.190
Perfect Jonouchi is back!

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:35.300
Wait!  We don't know why you were in a coma!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.440
You need a thorough exam!

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.310
Don't worry about it.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.630
Let's go!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:42.770
No.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.500
The doctor is right.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.640
You need to be examined.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.640
I know my body more than anyone else-

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:54.940
No, you don't!

00:07:54.940 --> 00:08:00.240
You were dying!  We were so worried!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.030
And you act like nothing happened.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:08.030
You should worry about your health instead of the duel!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:15.540
Anzu...  Sorry, but I have to go!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.310
Jonouchi!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:21.540
I'm sorry that I made you worry about me.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:26.320
But Yugi's fight isn't his alone.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.320
It's a fight to fulfill his promise with me.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.320
Promise with you?

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:38.340
I fight to fulfill my promise with Jonouchi.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:45.770
Until Yugi and I duel, our Battle City doesn't end.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:51.620
Yugi and I have both fought to become true duelists.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.330
Every duel leads to our future.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:59.280
So I want to watch, no matter the result.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.400
As long as Yugi's dueling, I'm going.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.790
I need to go!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.620
Jonouchi...

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:09.950
Shizuka!  Take care of Mai!

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.280
Brother!  Don't push yourself!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.220
Wait!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.170
I'm sorry.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:21.340
Hey!

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.340
Wait!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.140
I won't be held responsible!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.140
Yugi!  Don't lose!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:34.760
Which three cards did Kaiba keep?

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:38.350
Think.  Figure out his strategy.

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:42.360
That'll determine which three cards I should keep.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:47.130
He hasn't used the spell Monster Reborn in this duel yet.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.250
To maximize his attack for the remaining turns...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:55.760
...he needs to play Monster Reborn and get three Blue-Eyes.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:10:01.400
If he's planning to fuse the three Blue-Eyes to get Ultimate Dragon...

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.260
I'm choosing these cards!

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.650
I end my turn!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.770
You finally chose.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:17.160
But it doesn't matter what those cards are.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.530
You can't beat me.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.860
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.240
It's over for you, Yugi.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:30.410
I activate the spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.140
I knew it!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:37.670
The monster I'm reviving is, of course, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:48.690
I activate my set spell!

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:53.960
What?  He already set Polymerization?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.200
Be reborn, three Blue-Eyes!

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:10.620
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:16.440
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:21.220
Having more attack points than Obelisk, it's the strongest monster ever!

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.000
See, Yugi?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:27.560
This is the ultimate monster that clears the path to my future!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:49.950
Yugi!  I'll defeat you here to acquire something great!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:56.450
But it won't be something simple as revenge.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.820
Why was I so obsessed with fighting you?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:05.100
I've been fighting in Battle City to find that answer.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.470
And I finally found the answer.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:08.970
The answer?

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.070
Yes!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:17.080
Battle City started due to that tablet.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.740
It depicts the answer.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:25.950
Yugi, you fight in pursuit of the memories depicted in the tablet.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:31.960
It's foolish to pursue the past because it's never coming back.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.190
The past...

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.940
But I feel different.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:40.020
Memories of the past are worthless, like pebbles that crumble to dust.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:46.640
My brother and I lost our parents when we were young.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:50.640
Horrible adults put us in an orphanage.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.650
When Gozaburo Kaiba adopted us...

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:58.650
...we saw how ugly families can be and were forced to study without rest.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.350
And...

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:05.360
In a world of conspiracies and schemes, I seized absolute power.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.630
Kaiba Corporation's destruction and rebirth.

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:11.640
Revenge led to new hate!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.100
My past is nothing but hate and anger.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.340
Completely different than your silly illusions.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.960
I'm only interested in the future.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.580
The past is nothing but a stepping stone.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:28.040
Yugi, you're a symbol of the past.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:32.740
So by destroying you, my future will be glorious!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:36.590
When I gain the title of Duel King!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.390
Kaiba...

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:45.900
My brother is trying to forget the past by defeating Yugi?

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:54.920
We were poor, but it wasn't tough because I had my brother.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:58.200
Actually, it was fun!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.570
But...

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:09.160
He used to smile for real, but he's going to forget that?

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:14.900
The time has come to defeat you and stand at the top!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.000
You're in a dire situation, but you can still laugh?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.400
Kaiba, you're one of the few duelists that I respect.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.010
But you disappoint me.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.510
What?

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.270
I'll be honest!

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.040
Hatred?  Anger?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.750
You can't defeat me with those!

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.750
How pathetic to hear you whine.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.990
Will you think the same after seeing this?

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.710
I flip over my set card!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.390
I activate Double Spell!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.900
What?  Double Spell?

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:49.940
That's right.

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:54.900
I can use all spell cards that you used this turn.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:56.960
Monster Reborn!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.340
And Polymerization!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.910
I use Monster Reborn to summon Buster Blader!

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:05.310
Then I activate Polymerization!

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:11.640
I fuse Dark Magician and Buster Blader!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:16.060
Fuse Dark Magician and Buster Blader?

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:25.780
The warrior that I'm fusing inherits a part of Buster Blader's effects.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:31.100
It gains 500 attack points for every Dragon on the field.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:36.310
Ultimate Dragon and Red-Eyes are on the field.

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:37.920
I'll show you!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:41.020
Dark Paladin!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:54.560
You entertain me, Yugi.

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:01.540
A Fusion Monster can't attack on the turn that it's summoned.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.800
I end my turn.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.480
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.640
Kaiba.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:14.650
I'll set this card to destroy your hate and anger!

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:16.700
I set a card!

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:18.650
I end my turn!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.080
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:29.620
Yugi!  I'll bury you, along with the miserable past!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.960
Get ready!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:35.220
Kaiba, you have no future if you have no past!

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.270
What?

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:41.000
The past accumulates into the present and continues to the future.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.220
No past is meaningless.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:47.810
Everything leads to the present and the future!

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:52.550
I told you that I only care about the future.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.290
Brother...

00:16:54.290 --> 00:17:00.290
I'll overcome everything in Battle City and seize the Duel King title!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:02.800
I'll rise to greater heights!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:08.480
Kaiba, this Duel Tower that rises above the ruins symbolizes your heart.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:13.100
If you reach the top through hate, you won't achieve true victory!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:17.040
You'll keep searching for new hatred!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:23.050
Even if you defeat me, endless hate awaits you!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:26.790
You'll never escape from the darkness of hate!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:31.370
Hate and anger give me power!

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:33.530
The power to conquer all!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:38.220
Then strike me with all your hate and anger!

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.270
You still won't defeat me!

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:45.020
No matter what you say, I will win this turn!

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.360
Here I go!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:48.800
Ultimate Dragon attacks!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.640
I won't be defeated.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:54.050
I always fight for what I believe.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.450
For my friends.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.150
For myself.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:00.650
And I'll become a true duelist!

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:05.660
Kaiba, I'll defeat you!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:11.660
As a rival who fought through Battle City and also as a friend!

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:14.170
Ultimate Burst!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.270
I flip over my set card!

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.820
Magic Formula!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.200
It won't work!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:26.810
I activate Spell Absorption!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:31.840
When your monster gains attack points...

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:37.100
...this card absorbs those attack points and gives it to my monster!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:43.560
Ultimate Dragon gains 500 attack points!

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:53.310
Yugi, perish alongside Dark Paladin and your friend's Red-Eyes!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.010
It's over.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.510
All right!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.300
What's this?

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:07.890
Yugi!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.140
I win.

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.720
Are you sure?

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:18.630
Kaiba!  Even with all that hate, it's still weak!

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:20.130
What?

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:25.370
Hate and anger can't support the weight of victory!

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:26.580
Silence!

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.870
Your monster can't defeat Ultimate Dragon!

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:34.370
Then I'll show you my last attack for victory!

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:36.250
I flip over my set card!

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.780
De-Fusion!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.020
De-Fusion?

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:47.030
It splits up a Fusion Monster and negates its attack this turn!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:51.030
He knew I would summon Ultimate Dragon?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:20:00.300
Ultimate Dragon is splitting apart!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:12.060
Since there are two more Dragons on the field, Dark Paladin's attack points rise!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:19.170
And since Ultimate Dragon is no longer fused together, your turn ends!

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.490
What?

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.100
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:28.230
Kaiba!  I'll use this card to cut away the darkness ruling your heart!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:31.240
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.200
Diffusion Wave-Motion!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.090
Diffusion Wave-Motion!

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:42.800
By paying 1000 life points, my Spellcaster can attack all your monsters!

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:48.720
That means Dark Paladin's attack hits all three Blue-Eyes at the same time!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:52.740
Each Blue-Eyes has 3000 attack points.

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:55.730
His Dark Paladin has 4900!

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:58.530
Dark Paladin attacks!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:07.800
Kaiba!  Hate cannot lead to true victory!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.970
Super Magical Wave Slash!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:44.980
Kaiba, use this defeat to overcome your hate.

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:56.150
Hooray!  Yugi won!

00:21:56.320 --> 00:21:58.360
Kaiba is stunned.

00:21:58.360 --> 00:22:02.170
Yugi tells him that even though he won, they were evenly matched.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:07.020
He asks where the boundary lies between rivalry and friendship.

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:12.570
When Kaiba says he doesn't need help from friends, Jonouchi snaps back.

00:22:12.570 --> 00:22:15.220
What?  You're challenging Kaiba?

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:16.900
Are you serious?

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:21.240
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Blazing Road of a Scrub
Jonouchi vs Kaiba

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:22.940
Duel, standby!

00:22:29.270 --> 00:22:38.180
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:46.520
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:57.680
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:58.300 --> 00:23:07.210
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:16.230
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:21.740
I'll live feeling them

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:26.930
For me to be me

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:35.380
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:41.020
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:50.680
We'll both understand that someday
